00_Afwo8Kd5Gt6DDQfL1yMrJzPTdoWsO1IveUyrS2Qln9U-LQ&oe=69B54C61"}, {"file_name": "Squingle-Twinkled-Screenshot-03.png", "id": "1013963573823261", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974526_1013963577156594_2061989920474998390_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1IKKCyUAUP8Q7kNvwGgOrEa&_nc_oc=AdmEgnquIBZv8TJ6j9v0k8WfbZzGvfTCM-lFRQpGcqudC6brme49pJL9CeNvtwekSBk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwE1dso23H-813DPrvirbnwCAjEnA7vC0AlBf-F7gf_ig&oe=69B54616"}, {"file_name": "Squingle-Twinkled-Screenshot-05.png", "id": "2121495998306034", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982488_2121496001639367_6867377017957057624_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ObqNafFcHCYQ7kNvwGzOmLT&_nc_oc=AdlfIKTw8vKJbScB6qloa9jMuuH4mqLjelhuO2XCuPpZ_HpPNg0nhQRx_m2lRc79tSM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwI51C4HPBkUo-JPb3obUAqUDpXxBVOamutCPr6VKg6SA&oe=69B5602A"}, {"file_name": "Squingle-Twinkled-Screenshot-01.png", "id": "1186035523063640", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974783_1186035526396973_4771898997726366931_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xlHnnCku1rAQ7kNvwHW-zOm&_nc_oc=AdkIRX423j1-ER0gM5ZsoKTpL0teX6SVARv7GYjs6O-gbV1FCXVH-_dtSTd9HDc6gz0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyHgdMAVhq5l4iZWZHMzSeHXTaX3nCyUdpFhjVwHBkBJw&oe=69B53E0F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_Cover_Image.png", "id": "487841280996149", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031435_487841284329482_7014507726029390394_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c-0-9udLdtMQ7kNvwFtFww-&_nc_oc=Adl8YV3MtZXnkB_S17ny1WFpNJecQcjFrmCmSFhBX7owQQKfFDnmVcRjEiZs4rJz8ws&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw-jsccTHeyJn4o6VDpzbvr62FRknHbVHaWq9oYcrUMbg&oe=69B54171"}, "display_name": "Squingle", "keywords": ["puzzle", "mr", "puzzling", "squingle"], "long_description": "Squingle is a cosmic 3D puzzle game that could only exist in VR.\n\nYour challenge is to guide 2 spinning orbs to the goal through intricate, glass-like mazes called \u2018squingles.\u2019 \n\nEach level offers a mesmerizing visual experience, featuring dynamic, morphing sculptures that come to life in fully immersive environments or in Mixed Reality. \n\nWith intuitive controls and hand-tracking support, Squingle will captivate your mind and spirit.\n\n#  \u2728 100 LEVELS\nLaunching with 100 levels, with more added over time. Levels grow complex, featuring tighter spaces and new challenges.\n\n# \ud83c\udf08 A VISUAL MASTERPIECE\nEach maze is a stunning, morphing sculpture, offering an unmatched visual experience in Mixed Reality or fully immersive modes.\n\n# \ud83e\udde9 EASY TO PICK, HARD TO MASTER\nDesigned to be accessible for both newcomers to VR and experts seeking a transcendent experience, with intuitive controls and hand tracking support for seamless play, whether standing or seated.\n\n# \ud83d\ude0c RELAX & UNWIND\nPlay on the sofa or in room-sized mazes. Squingle\u2019s calming gameplay will soothe your soul.\n\n# \ud83c\udfc5 AWARDS\n- Best VR Game ~ GDWC Finalist\n- Finalist ~ QLDXR Festival\n- \u201cBest of the Quest\u201d ~ Gibby\u2019s Guide\n\n# FEATURES\n- Challenge Mode: Time trials and global leaderboards.\n- Room/Mini scale: Play big or small!\n- Race your ghost: Beat your best times.\n\n\nGet ready to be Squingled!", "short_description": "Squingle is a cosmic 3D puzzle game that could only exist in VR.\n\nYour challenge is to guide 2 spinning orbs to the goal through intricate, glass-like mazes called \u2018squingles.\u2019 \n\nEach level offers a mesmerizing visual experience, featuring dynamic, morphing sculptures that come to life in fully immersive environments or in Mixed Reality. \n\nWith intuitive controls and hand-tracking support, Squingle will captivate your mind and spirit."}]}, "developer_name": "Dr.